    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eBuy chicken breast in bulk.\u003c/strong\u003e The big family packs run far cheaper per pound than the small trays. Grab it when it dips under a couple dollars a pound and freeze what you are not cooking today.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eSkip the pricey Italian seasoning jar.\u003c/strong\u003e If you already own oregano, basil, and parsley, mix your own. It is the same herbs for a fraction of the cost.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eWatch the parmesan.\u003c/strong\u003e A wedge you grate yourself lasts longer and tastes stronger than the pre-shredded tubs, so a little goes a long way across all 14 servings."
